      "verifiedAt": "2026-09-11",
      "caveat": "Original gstack source snapshot. L11 maps upstream gstack paths to .l11/upstream/gstack and owns routing. Browser/runtime builds need Bash, Bun, dependencies and Chromium; Windows browser also needs the Node server build. Setup scripts are shipped as source, never automatically executed or registered. The legacy connect-chrome directory symlink is omitted; its open-gstack-browser target is included as source. Git ignore metadata is omitted so npm cannot suppress original runtime helpers during packaging."
    },
    {
